All,

At yesterday's (April 4, 2005) monthly FSG/Open-Printing Steering Committee
Meeting it was noted that several of the specifications and APIs are nearing
completion and will need to be reviewed.  One of the principle review groups
will be the Architecture Team.   Therefore, I have been asked to send out
this message to members of architecture mail list so that each of you can
look for, review and comment on specifications and APIs as they become
available for review.  Below is a rough schedule of when various
specifications and APIs are expected to be available for review.


Job Ticket API (JTAPI)			April 2005 (Currently in Steering
Committee)

Reference Model			May-June 2005

Program API (PAPI)			May-June 2005

Print Channel Manager (PCM)		June-July 2005

Raster Driver (part of Vector Driver)	August-September 2005

Vector Driver				September-October 2005

Status Monitoring			First/Second Quarter 2006

The FSG/Open-Printing Steering Committee will attempt to update the list and
schedule above at their monthly meetings.
Rgds, 
Glen W. Petrie 
